			(property "Description" "Solder Jumper - Closed\n\nThese solder jumpers are closed by default\n\n• CLOSEDWIRE - 10 mil trace between pads that can be cut and resoldered later\n• CLOSEDPERM - 63 mil trace between pads for a permanent connection (used to 'bridge' two signals, a shameless hack for Eagle).  Can double as a test point as well (no cream layer)"
